{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S11、S12等较短时段仍安排了较多话句和连续感受提示，即使感受按小节出现，观众也可能忙于追踪文字而顾不上听音乐；X的完整叙述更容易一口气读出人物的心理过程。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮短语把每段心理转折标得更醒目，感受又跟随音乐实际出现，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住当下重点。尤其是音乐描写，Y不仅表达情绪，还提供了节奏、音色、力度、动作和身体感受等具体线索，细腻程度明显更好。X的完整叙述在因果衔接上略顺，但Y对人物反复经历的怀念、孤独、犹豫以及最终选择的呈现同样完整，因此整体仍选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e317ca9d-5e92-4b21-8d74-5559d60204a8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T205438113999Z", "elapsed_seconds": 94.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:56:12.153208+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "baa0b59a764b513fc3075c94759d184b570a5dd56d3c7f0e5c6ca3e992228909", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg